+    ),
+    "reduction_source": "paper_central",
+    "intuition_type": "constraint propagation",
+    "intuition_description": (
+        "The target and total-weight equality force every capacity inequality "
+        "to be tight, turning allocation into propagation among complementary "
+        "weight pairs; without that observation one searches arbitrary bundles."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track A: Theorem 3 via Section 6's strongly NP-complete RN3DM regime, "
