+"""Verified problem generator for arXiv:2605.05233.
+
+The paper's Section 6 proves hardness for bottleneck multiple knapsack even
+when every item has unit profit.  Its reduction makes two copies of every
+weight 1,...,n and asks whether n arbitrary-capacity knapsacks can each receive
+two items.  This module inverse-generates exactly the YES side of that native
+BMKP construction and retains the allocation as a certificate.
+"""
+
+from __future__ import annotations
