-    },
-}
-
-NOTES = (
-    "Section 3 fixes BMKP feasibility as disjoint item subsets respecting each "
-    "capacity, and Section 6 (Definition 39 and the proof of Theorem 3) fixes "
-    "the hard unit-profit regime used here: two copies of weights 1 through n, "
-    "n arbitrary capacities, and optimum either one or two. Theorems 1 and 2 "
-    "are the relevant easy-side results: for fixed epsilon they compute only "
-    "2/3-epsilon and 1/2-epsilon approximations, not the exact target-2 "
-    "certificate. Instances are inverse-generated from two independent random "
