Implemented a native Track B bottleneck-knapsack generator based on the paper’s BMKP definition and unit-profit setting. The certificate is constructed from equal-sum modular orbits, never found by solving the generated instance. See the [paper](https://arxiv.org/html/2605.05233v1).

Deliverables:

- [gen_2605_05233.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2605.05233/gen_2605_05233.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2605.05233/selftest_report.json)
- [README.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2605.05233/README.md)
- [llm_loop_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2605.05233/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [G9 hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2605.05233/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
