- Compact structural route: 288 exact operations.
- Answer: 475 characters, 144 atoms.

The family follows the paper’s native BMKP definition and honestly avoids claiming average-case hardness. The paper’s efficient results are approximation algorithms, while exact target allocation underlies its hardness result in Section 6. [Full paper](https://arxiv.org/html/2605.05233v1)

